{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEP","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"西番雅書","commonName":"西番雅書","title":"西番雅書","order":36,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"4d1e9971ea998a363ca860048ef6d06977238fc9a10c7eaa9b21fe90af9c4689","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":52},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["呼籲百姓悔改"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"不知羞恥的國民哪，你們應當聚集！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"趁命令沒有發出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日子過去如風前的糠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的烈怒未臨到你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他發怒的日子未到以先，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們應當聚集前來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世上遵守耶和華典章的謙卑人哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們都當尋求耶和華！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當尋求公義謙卑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或者在耶和華發怒的日子可以隱藏起來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列鄰國的結局"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"迦薩必致見棄；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞實基倫必然荒涼。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人在正午必趕出亞實突的民；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以革倫也被拔出根來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住沿海之地的基利提族有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦南、非利士人之地啊，耶和華的話與你反對，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說：我必毀滅你，以致無人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沿海之地要變為草場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其上有牧人的住處和羊群的圈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這地必為猶大家剩下的人所得；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必在那裏牧放群羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"晚上必躺臥在亞實基倫的房屋中；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華－他們的上帝必眷顧他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們被擄的人歸回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"我聽見摩押人的毀謗和亞捫人的辱罵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是毀謗我的百姓，自誇自大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"侵犯他們的境界。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華－以色列的上帝說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我指着我的永生起誓：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押必像所多瑪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞捫人必像蛾摩拉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都變為刺草、鹽坑、永遠荒廢之地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我百姓所剩下的必擄掠他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我國中所餘剩的必得着他們的地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"這事臨到他們是因他們驕傲，自誇自大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀謗萬軍之耶和華的百姓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必向他們顯可畏之威，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他必叫世上的諸神瘦弱。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國海島的居民各在自己的地方敬拜他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"古實人哪，你們必被我的刀所殺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"耶和華必伸手攻擊北方，毀滅亞述，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使尼尼微荒涼，又乾旱如曠野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"群畜，就是各國","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"的走獸必臥在其中；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鵜鶘和箭豬要宿在柱頂上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在窗戶內有鳴叫的聲音；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"門檻都必毀壞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"香柏木已經露出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是素來歡樂安然居住的城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心裏說：惟有我，除我以外再沒有別的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在何竟荒涼成為野獸躺臥之處！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡經過的人都必搖手嗤笑她。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"國：或譯類","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}